%% ACTIRA — Human-in-the-Loop policy
flowchart TD
  IN[severity + grounding_score + settings] --> S{severity >= hitl_severity_min?}
  S -->|yes| PR[pending_review HiTL]
  S -->|no| G{grounding < threshold?}
  G -->|yes| PR
  G -->|no| A{grounding >= auto_approve_min?}
  A -->|yes| AP[approved auto]
  A -->|no| NEW[status new]
  note1[Auto-approve never bypasses severity gate]
